{"id":"6c3fde9678004cd6","group":"58","path":"58/batch18/58-df-zfc-game4-reachability-game.md","title":"ZFC Game4 Reachability Game","display":"df-zfc-game4-reachability-game — ZFC Game4 Reachability Game","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-game4-reachability-game","aliases":["58-df-zfc-game4-reachability-game"],"display":"df-zfc-game4-reachability-game — ZFC Game4 Reachability Game","depends_on":["[[58-ax-zfc]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-game4-reachability-game"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-game4-reachability-game</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-game4-reachability-game — ZFC Game4 Reachability Game"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"58-ax-zfc\">58-ax-zfc</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G,s_\\ast,T\\in V\">\\(G,s_\\ast,T\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcGame4ReachabilityGame}_S\\subseteq V^3\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcGame4ReachabilityGame}_S\\subseteq V^3\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}game4\\text{-}reachability\\text{-}game}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcGame4ReachabilityGame}_S(G,s_\\ast,T)\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists S,S_0,S_1,R,W\\;\\bigl(&amp;G=\\langle S,S_0,S_1,R,W\\rangle\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land S=S_0\\mathbin{\\dot\\cup}S_1\n\\land R\\subseteq S\\times S\n\\land\\forall s\\in S\\;\\exists t\\in S\\;(\\langle s,t\\rangle\\in R)\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land s_\\ast\\in S\\land T\\subseteq S\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land W=\\{p\\in S^\\omega:p(0)=s_\\ast\n\\land\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;(\\langle p(n),p(n+1)\\rangle\\in R)\n\\land\\exists n\\in\\omega\\;(p(n)\\in T)\\}\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}game4\\text{-}reachability\\text{-}game}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcGame4ReachabilityGame}_S(G,s_\\ast,T)\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists S,S_0,S_1,R,W\\;\\bigl(&amp;G=\\langle S,S_0,S_1,R,W\\rangle\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land S=S_0\\mathbin{\\dot\\cup}S_1\n\\land R\\subseteq S\\times S\n\\land\\forall s\\in S\\;\\exists t\\in S\\;(\\langle s,t\\rangle\\in R)\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land s_\\ast\\in S\\land T\\subseteq S\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land W=\\{p\\in S^\\omega:p(0)=s_\\ast\n\\land\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;(\\langle p(n),p(n+1)\\rangle\\in R)\n\\land\\exists n\\in\\omega\\;(p(n)\\in T)\\}\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Auxiliary ZFC definition.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-ax-zfc]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"G,s_\\ast,T\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcGame4ReachabilityGame}_S\\subseteq V^3","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}game4\\text{-}reachability\\text{-}game}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcGame4ReachabilityGame}_S(G,s_\\ast,T)\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists S,S_0,S_1,R,W\\;\\bigl(&G=\\langle S,S_0,S_1,R,W\\rangle\\\\\n&{}\\land S=S_0\\mathbin{\\dot\\cup}S_1\n\\land R\\subseteq S\\times S\n\\land\\forall s\\in S\\;\\exists t\\in S\\;(\\langle s,t\\rangle\\in R)\\\\\n&{}\\land s_\\ast\\in S\\land T\\subseteq S\\\\\n&{}\\land W=\\{p\\in S^\\omega:p(0)=s_\\ast\n\\land\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;(\\langle p(n),p(n+1)\\rangle\\in R)\n\\land\\exists n\\in\\omega\\;(p(n)\\in T)\\}\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true}],"bytes":1046,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-2209","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch18/58-df-zfc-game4-reachability-game.md|58-df-zfc-game4-reachability-game]]（batch18）"}],"outgoing":["a3348ed9eb6fb4e3"]}